     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_eima_shehaisha_kshera",
     "gloss_en": "אימא: לעדות שהאשה כשרה לה בלבד -- read: only for testimony for which a woman is valid (= p_eima_shehaisha_kshera_lah)",
